{"id":"f32ef993d95e406c","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-finite-string-dimension.md","title":"有限串相对于终止鞅的维数","display":"df-finite-string-dimension — 有限串相对于终止鞅的维数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-finite-string-dimension","aliases":["43-df-finite-string-dimension"],"display":"df-finite-string-dimension — 有限串相对于终止鞅的维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-termgale]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definitions 17.11.7 and 17.11.9","source_printed_pages":"547","source_pdf_pages":"567","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-finite-string-dimension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-finite-string-dimension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-string-dimension — 有限串相对于终止鞅的维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6501493b1a4f2e7\" href=\"?note=c6501493b1a4f2e7\" title=\"43-df-termgale\">43-df-termgale</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definitions 17.11.7 and 17.11.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"547"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"567"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\square\">\\(\\sigma\\square\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Termgale}\">\\(\\operatorname{Termgale}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}\">\\(\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6501493b1a4f2e7\" href=\"?note=c6501493b1a4f2e7\" title=\"43-df-termgale\">43-df-termgale</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,D^*\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\">\\(D,D^*\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\\)</span>，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D^*)\">\\(\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D^*)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^*\">\\(D^*\\)</span> 固定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；下确界在非负扩展实数中求取，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty\">\\(\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_D^\\ell(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in[0,\\infty):D_s(\\sigma\\square)&gt;\\ell\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_D^\\ell(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in[0,\\infty):D_s(\\sigma\\square)&gt;\\ell\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{\\square}(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\dim_{D^*}^1(\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_{\\square}(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\dim_{D^*}^1(\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>普通终止鞅可能在某个终止串上恒为零，此时相对维数为无穷；固定最优有效终止鞅后的维数由下一定理保证有限。这里的有限串维数不同于单点 Cantor 集的经典 Hausdorff 维数。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Definitions 17.11.7 and 17.11.9，印刷页 547，PDF 页 567。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-termgale","status":"resolved","id":"c6501493b1a4f2e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-termgale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-termgale","status":"resolved","id":"c6501493b1a4f2e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T$、$\\sigma\\square$、$\\operatorname{Termgale}$、$\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}$ 见 [[43-df-termgale]]。$D,D^*\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}$，并假设 $\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)$、$\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D^*)$；$D^*$ 固定。$\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$；下确界在非负扩展实数中求取，$\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\square","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Termgale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}","display":false},{"tex":"D,D^*\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D^*)","display":false},{"tex":"D^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim_D^\\ell(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in[0,\\infty):D_s(\\sigma\\square)>\\ell\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\dim_{\\square}(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\dim_{D^*}^1(\\sigma).","display":true}],"bytes":1749,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-456","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-finite-string-dimension]] — 有限串相对于终止鞅的维数"},{"id":"61dd587baa22cc0f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal T$、$\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}$ 见 [[43-df-termgale]]；$\\dim_D^\\ell$、固定 $D^*$ 的 $\\dim_{\\square}$ 见 [[43-df-finite-string-dimension]]；$K$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。所量化 $D,E$ 为 $[0,\\infty)$ 到 $[0,\\infty)^{\\mathcal T}$ 的族。"}],"outgoing":["c6501493b1a4f2e7"]}